g", "id": "277489128156801", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974750_277489134823467_4204457001143684943_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-8LI9r1hFF8Q7kNvwG39Tto&_nc_oc=Adowmy5MinPc5dmw-lW7g_mUzAJjUFmYAdq8MZAiLPXWjKpN3k2Q5WOEKhjokJvu1wg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRFKKo8aKvsqWLYxNZVxlaeWhTubpAh5898nSuGlsVsjg&oe=6AFF1F64"}, "display_name": "TritonVR 2: Next Gen MR Warfare", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The next generation of VR is here. Created from the ground-up and iterating on its predecessor, TritonVR 2 combines thrilling yet accessible VR combat with platform-defining shared-space gameplay - you\u2019ll need to move around your play area in real life to move in the game, in custom-built maps designed for any playspace size.\n\nSettle your differences in fast-paced and high-stakes PvP warfare, both online or locally. And new to the series is the next-generation map editor, World Weaver. Utilising the latest tech advancements, this editor will intelligently build a map from your exact play-space dimensions to create a one-of-a-kind map that you and your friends can battle on.", "short_description": "Turn any playspace into the ultimate multiplayer combat arena in TritonVR 2! Using cutting-edge tech, TritonVR 2 allows you to turn any area into a battlefield, with up to 4 players simultaneously able to compete in the action."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.tetrastudios.com.au/privacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tetra Studios", "support_website_url": "https://www.tetrastudios.com.au/contact", "website_url": "https://www.tetrastudios.com.au/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "6443